    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43904" root="&#xA;                        نزع&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            3
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَازَعَهُ الحَبْلَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He contended with him in pulling the rope;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاذَبَهُ إِيَّاهُ</span>. Hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نازعه فى</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَذَا</span> (tropical:)  <i>He contended, disputed,</i> or <i>litigated, with
him, respecting such a thing.</i> (Mgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَازَعَهُ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الكَلَامَ</span> (tropical:)  <i>He disputed with him in, or respecting,
words.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَازَعَتْنِى نَفْسِى إِلَى هَواهَا</span>, inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِزَاعْ</span>, <i>My soul strove with me to incline me to
love her.</i> (TA.) See 1.

